<Base reading title="Good questions. Clear next steps." description="Find the right place to begin your conversation."><PageIntro title="Good questions. Clear next steps." eyebrow="FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS" description="Find the right place to begin your conversation."/><section class="wrap reading"><div class="faq-group"><details id="speaking"><summary>Speaking: How do I inquire about an event?</summary><p>Share the date or say undecided, the audience, location or virtual format and your desired outcome. <a href="/contact/?service=speaking">Start here →</a></p></details><details id="coaching"><summary>Coaching: Where do I discuss coaching formats?</summary><p>Describe your goals and any preference for individual or focused coaching. Scope and availability are discussed directly. <a href="/contact/?service=coaching">Start here →</a></p></details><details id="writing"><summary>Keynote Writing: Can I bring an early draft?</summary><p>Include your starting material, audience, occasion, deadline and talk length in your inquiry. <a href="/contact/?service=keynote-writing">Start here →</a></p></details><details id="program"><summary>The Mindset Revolution: Where can I ask about the program?</summary><p>Use the dedicated program inquiry to ask about fit, format and enrollment details. <a href="/contact/?service=program">Start here →</a></p></details><details id="guests"><summary>Bathrobe Moments: How do I express interest in being a guest?</summary><p>Introduce yourself, share a proposed topic and include your website or social profile if you have one. An inquiry does not confirm a guest appearance. <a href="/bathrobe-moments/apply/">Start here →</a></p></details></div></section></Base>
